  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The e-Health project is part of UNDPs inclusive and multi-sectoral response to COVID-19 through digital transformation. Under this project, the existing paper-based health care system will be replaced by a modern and integrated e-Health system in all public regional and health care centres. It aims at improving the quality of health services across the island, and achieving an inclusive health sector through structural transformation. Supported by the Government of Japan, the project will also</narrative>
  </description>
